Worth knowing about the physiological sigh: the five-minute daily version is the only dose tested in a trial (Stanford, 2023). The quick one-to-three-sigh reset is plausible but untested.

For a mid-scroll reset: phone face-down, two or three slow sighs, let your jaw and shoulders drop. Stop if you feel tingly or lightheaded.
